# Arter CSS and shared UI

Visual overrides belong in `public/css/styles.css` only. Keep `art-*` and `elementor-*` classes. Do not modernize or restyle markup to a new system.

Do not edit `public/themes/arter/**` or `public/plugins/**` unless a one-off bug is justified.

Shared chrome (default layout + sidebar + menu) is used site-wide. After any include/layout/CSS change, verify these six surfaces: Home, About, Blog, one post, Portfolio, Contact. Check desktop ~1440 and mobile ~390.

```css
/* BAD: restyle by replacing Arter class names in HTML */
.hero-v2 { ... }

/* GOOD: override the existing Arter selector */
.art-banner .art-banner-overlay .art-banner-title h1 { color: #ffffff; }
```
